<FTL>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_aux_shields">Duration: %i / Speed: %gx</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_aux_shields_boost">Overclock the Auxiliary Shields system, temporarily boosting the speed. Afterwards system becomes locked for %d seconds.\nHotkey: %s</text>

<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_desc_single">%i charge</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_desc_plural">%i charges</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_weapon_enable">Enable consumption of Weapon Amplification charges for this weapon.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_weapon_disable">Disable consumption of Weapon Amplification charges for this weapon.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_current_enhancement">Current Enhancement: %s</text>

<text name="oe_aux_shields">Auxiliary Shields</text>
<text name="oe_aux_shields_installed">Auxiliary Shields System installed</text>

<text name="tooltip_oe_aux_shields">Auxiliary Shields: Generates super shield layers over time, can be boosted for a much higher rate temporarily.</text>
<text name="tooltip_oe_aux_shields_enemy">Auxiliary Shields: Generates super shield layers.</text>

<text name="oe_grease">Weapons Amplifier</text>
<text name="oe_grease_installed">Weapons Amplifier System installed</text>

<text name="tooltip_oe_grease">Weapons Amplifier:  Enhances the weapons you fire, can be modified to provide different effects.</text>
<text name="tooltip_oe_grease_enemy">Weapons Amplifier: Enhances the weapons the enemy fires, depending on the enemy the system will enhance their weapons in different ways.</text>

<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_fire">Causes the last projectile in the volley to start a fire on hit.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_frost">Causes the last projectile in the volley to create a short lockdown on hit.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_breach">Causes the last projectile in the volley to open a breach on hit.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_shock">Causes the last projectile in the volley to break and stun all doors in the room.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_shatter">Causes the last projectile in the volley to create an extremely weak lockdown, the next hit to this room while the lockdown is active will do 2x damage.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_acidic">Causes the last projectile in the volley to create acidic that erodes the system on hit.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_inculcation">Causes the last projectile in the volley to create inculcation gas on hit.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_marked">Causes the last projectile in the volley to target all friendly drones on hit.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_resurrection">When a projectile kills a crewmember, temporarily resurrect that crewmember on your side.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_cascade">When a projectile full breaks a system, deal system damage to an adjacent room.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_dd_soulplagued">Causes the last projectile in the volley to inflict the Plagueridden effect.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_dd_darkness">Causes the last projectile in the volley to inflict a chaotic, and potentially dark effect.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_dd_shadow_frost">Causes the last projectile in the volley to inflict a series of Shadow-Crystal lockdowns, and potentially spawn a Hungering Shadow.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_dd_radiant">Causes the last projectile in the volley to inflict the Radiant Desecration effect, and spawn a random Lightborne.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_grease_effect_chaos">Causes the last projectile in the volley to trigger a random effect that you have available.</text>

<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_level">Speed: %g tiles/second</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_button_hover">Manage Life Bloom System.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_button_disabled_hover">Life Bloom System cannot be changed while in danger.</text>

<text name="oe_growth">Life Bloom</text>
<text name="oe_growth_installed">Life Bloom System installed</text>

<text name="tooltip_oe_growth">Life Bloom: Grows across the ship, budding into rooms to provide oxygen and other effects.</text>
<text name="tooltip_oe_growth_enemy">Life Bloom: Grows across the enemy ship, budding into rooms to provide oxygen and sometimes other effects.</text>

<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_oxygen">Generates enough oxygen to sustain 3 rooms</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_floral">Friendly crew in the same room gain 20% Max Health, repair speed, and healing speed</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_vampweed">Enemy crew in the same room lose 15% of their Max Health and move 25% slower</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_praetor">Max rooms: 1\nAll allied crew in the same room gain doubled Max Health, repair speed, and power generation.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_cultivator">Max rooms: 3\nNearby enemies take 60% increased damage from ANY source and are stunned 50% longer.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_acidic">Releases Acidic Gas into the current room, repairs breaches over 10 seconds.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_suffocating">Drains the room of oxygen, Enemy crew in the same room take 50% more suffocation damage.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_entangling">Momentarily roots moving enemy crew in place for 1 second, dealing 15 damage, can retrigger after 0.5 seconds.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_electrified">Max room: 1\nProvides 1 bonus power, destroys enemy hacking drones that attach to this room at the end of their effect.</text>
<text name="oe_lua_sys_growth_effect_root">Place the root of the system, the point in which the plant grows from.</text>
</FTL>